    "body": "Potential followups to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40325 . Some of these depend on \"demand\", i.e. waiting to hear from someone actually wanting them.\n\n- [x] Drop `CHECK_CMDWIN` (\"E11: Invalid in command-line window\"), allow chaos. https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40484\n- [x] Unify `BUFLOCK_OK` / `LOCK_OK` ?\n- [ ] Eliminate `nvim__cmdwin_set` \n- [ ] Support cmdwin-from-expr-register (`<c-r>= c-f`) and `input()` https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40463\n- [x] do we need to worry about 'scrollbind'? https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40556 https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/4d9e5acfb5ee081b5b0761205c8a8c36ed7e49e5/src/nvim/buffer.c#L4230",
