        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Whoops. My personal stuff calls `vim.ui.input()` which is internally calling `input()`. I forgot that `input()` is synchronous while `vim.ui.input()` isn't. My bad. An enhanced `vim.ui.input()` could reduce the demand for something like #40463 (for me at least), but I agree that it wouldn't completely remove it. I'll be fine with that approach.",
